ever converted to float; validated as string, compared/summed via BigInt tiyin to avoid rounding errors."}, {"id": "docs_frontend_branch_iana_time", "label": "Branch IANA time zone display (lib/time.ts)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/FRONTEND.md", "source_location": "L174", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "UTC instants rendered in branch IANA zone with Intl only; countdowns informational, server owns deadlines."}, {"id": "docs_frontend_i18n_sections", "label": "i18n sections (uz, uz-Cyrl, ru, en) with typed keys", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/FRONTEND.md", "source_location": "L177", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "ru/en typed as Record<keyof typeof uz, string> so a missing key fails the build."}, {"id": "docs_frontend_uz_cyrl_transliteration", "label": "Automatic uz-Cyrl transliteration (translit.ts + uzCyrlOverrides.ts)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/FRONTEND.md", "source_location": "L185", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_frontend_uzbek_apostrophe_standard", "label": "Uzbek apostrophe standard (U+2018 / U+2019)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/FRONTEND.md", "source_location": "L186", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Normalizes mixed o'/o\u2018 spellings for consistent text quality (weakness C12)."}, {"id": "docs_frontend_add_i18n_script", "label": "add-i18n.py key script", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/FRONTEND.md", "source_location": "L187", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_frontend_lazy_chunks", "label": "Lazy route chunks (patient, clinic, admin, telegram)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/FRONTEND.md", "source_location": "L76", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author